ects inside themselves entirely.\n\nIMO the smartest approach would be option 1, but I don't know if this would have any downsides, and might have some overhead. Option 4 seems like the best solution, because it won't cost any extra overhead, and users can just move their duplicate themselves.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358534330/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368424597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111063#issuecomment-3368424597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111063","id":3368424597,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IxhSV","user":{"login":"GlitchedCode922","id":126592994,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4un4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126592994?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922","html_url":"https://github.com/GlitchedCode922","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T17:16:12Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T17:16:12Z","body":"It also allows 